    "name": {
      "zh": "Famicom（红白机）",
      "en": "Famicom (Family Computer)"
    },
    "spec_version": "0.2",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "engine_min_version": "0.1.0",
    "precision_level": "L2",
    "era": 1983,
    "manufacturer": "Nintendo",
    "category": "game-console",
    "description": "1983 年任天堂推出的红白配色家用游戏机，以 Ricoh 2A03 处理器与 2C02 图像处理单元实现 256×240 的卷轴与精灵渲染，复苏了北美游戏业。",
    "authors": [
      {
        "name": "箱庭电子博物馆项目组",
        "role": "author"
      }
    ],
    "intro": {
      "zh": "Famicom（Family Computer，家庭电脑）是任天堂于 1983 年推出的 8 位家用游戏机，因其红白配色被称为红白机。它以 Ricoh 2A03 处理器与 2C02 图像处理单元为核心，用 256×240 的硬件卷轴与 64 个精灵带来了流畅的横版游戏体验，并靠严格的卡带授权体系复苏了 1983 年崩溃后的北美游戏业，确立了现代主机商业模式的雏形。",
      "en": "The Famicom (Family Computer), known for its red-and-white design, is an 8-bit home console released by Nintendo in 1983. Built around the Ricoh 2A03 CPU and the 2C02 Picture Processing Unit, it delivered hardware scrolling and 64 sprites at 256×240, and its strict cartridge licensing system revived the North American game industry after the 1983 crash."
    },
